现在重写 GameView.java，加入所有新功能。

设计：

```java
public abstract class GameView extends View implements Choreographer.FrameCallback {

    // 常量...

    // 几何...
    protected float w, h, cx, cy, R, safe;
    protected boolean ready;      // 尺寸就绪

    // 暂停菜单按钮
    private static final int BTN_NONE = -1;
    private static final int BTN_RESUME = 0;
    private static final int BTN_MENU = 1;

    // 三击计数
    private int scoreTaps;
    private long firstTapAt;

    // 存档
    private String pendingState;
    private boolean stateApplied;

    ...
}
```

`onDraw`：
```java
protected void onDraw(Canvas c) {
    c.drawColor(BG);
    drawGame(c);
    drawHud(c);
}
```

去掉 c.save()/restore()（没用）。

`doFrame`：
```java
if (!paused && !over && ready) update(dt);
```

`onAttachedToWindow`：
```java
best = Prefs.best(...);
pendingState = Prefs.state(...);
resetGame();
startLoop();
```

`onSizeChanged`：
```java
计算几何
ready = true;
onLayoutReady();
applyPendingState();
```

`applyPendingState`：
```java
private void applyPendingState() {
    if (stateApplied) return;
    stateApplied = true;
    if (pendingState != null && !pendingState.isEmpty()) {
