- Controls: Handler hide after 3.5s; any tap shows. Buttons: close circle top-left (52..104, 40..92) → finish; progress bar bottom (60..406, y 412 h 8) with times; center play/pause button circle r=34 at center when paused or controls visible.
- Seek: tap on progress bar → seek to ratio.
- onCompletion → finish.
- Error → toast + finish.
- Audio focus: skip (v1).

