c.drawBitmap(bm, srcI, rectI(th), null);
```
Simplest: helper in Ui: `public static void drawFit(Canvas c, Bitmap b, RectF dst)` computing with Matrix or using drawBitmap(bm, null, dst, null) — no, same overload issue. Use Paint with drawBitmap(Bitmap, Rect, Rect, Paint): convert with Rect.roundOut.

