   SR.set((int)((bw-sw)/2), (int)((bh-sh)/2), (int)((bw+sw)/2), (int)((bh+sh)/2));
   DR...
}
```
Gallery uses simple drawBitmap into cell (aspect stretch ok or fit): use bitmap() (stretch full cell) — for grid, crop-fill looks better: use bitmapCrop both.

