Wait errors counted 5: 2 drawBitmap (VideosScreen lines...), 3 showUi. GalleryScreen and ViewerScreen drawBitmap errors should also appear... unless javac stopped? "5 errors" — hmm maybe Gallery/Viewer errors exist but the tail truncated earlier lines. Whatever — fix all.

