Drag: fields dragging, dragRatio. In touch: DOWN inside barHit (only if hasNow) → dragging=true, update; MOVE → if dragging update dragRatio & invalidate (return, don't scroll); UP → seek(dragRatio*dur), dragging=false. Careful with scroll begin: sc.begin(y) on DOWN — if starting drag, skip scroll: handle DOWN: if hasNow && barHit.contains → dragging=true; else sc.begin.

List duration: it.duration==0 → show size only + trigger bg fetch. Lazy: static HashMap<String,Long> DUR; ExecutorService single. When apply() called, launch one bg task that iterates items with duration==0 (and not in DUR), retrieves via MediaMetadataRetriever, puts into DUR, then post invalidate (throttle: invalidate once after all done + every 10 items?). Simple: after each 8 items post invalidate. 

