rawContent.text:
Also check onDraw seeThrough condition: seeThrough = stack==1 && (homeExitDrag || exitAnim!=null). At onAnimationEnd we set exitAnim=null BEFORE finishing → seeThrough becomes false → if any draw happened between, it would draw BG + disc at ex=offscreen... disc offscreen anyway but BG would fill black → flash black! Actually worse. And also at end of update listener, ex=to=W so disc off-screen, but seeThrough false after exitAnim=null → onDraw would draw full BG (black) covering desktop → "闪回应用内"? No, that'd be black flash.

Fix plan: in onAnimationEnd: keep exitAnim reference or a flag `exitDone=true` so seeThrough stays true; set ex=to; invalidate(); postDelayed finish ~60ms (3-4 frames at high refresh). Implement:

```java
if (an == exitAnim) {
    exitAnim = null;
    seeThroughHold = true;   // 保持透出桌面状态
    ex = to; ey = 0f;
    invalidate();            // 提交最后一帧全透明画面
    MainActivity a = (MainActivity) getContext();
    a.shell.postDelayed(() -> {
        a.finish();
        try { a.overridePendingTransition(0, 0); } catch (Throwable ignored) {}
    }, 80);
}
```

Need field `seeThroughHold` in ShellView and include in seeThrough condition. Find seeThrough line.

